**Engineering Integration:**
The engineering team led by CTO Dr. Evelyn Reed provides technical oversight and R&D support. Key engineering dependencies include design specifications for Falcon UAV Program, integration with Falcon UAV Program, and technology transfer from the Orion Energy Hub - Copenhagen. Engineering resources are allocated at 18% capacity, with critical path activities including system architecture design, prototype development, and validation testing.

